EVHardware (vendored)
=====================

Source: https://github.com/fatihdonmezdev/MG4ABRP (EVHardware/lib)
Upstream project also publishes as com.evsuite:evhardware.

Only the Android library sources under this directory are included in DiPlay-MG4.
